defstate us_script
ifvare LEVEL 0 // Level 1 - Gathering Intel
{
    //Quote 200 is left blank to clear lines
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke!
    redefinequote 202 General Graves here.
    redefinequote 203 
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 We've lost contact with 
    redefinequote 206 Area 51 and scattered
    redefinequote 207 reports are that an alien 
    redefinequote 208 species has infiltrated it.
    redefinequote 209 We need you to go in,
    redefinequote 210 gather intelligence on
    redefinequote 211 what they are up to,
    // quote 212 is basically the limit of what the dialog box can hold for reference
    redefinequote 212 and wipe the bastards out. 
    redefinequote 213 I'm on it.
    redefinequote 214 
    redefinequote 215 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 Looks like the damned
    redefinequote 218 teleporter malfunctioned,
    redefinequote 219 leaving me only with my 
    redefinequote 220 Desert Eagle.
    redefinequote 221 I'm gonna need to acquire 
    redefinequote 222 some new hardware.
    redefinequote 223 
    redefinequote 224 
    redefinequote 225 Let's rock.
    redefinequote 226 
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 /!&
    redefinequote 229 General, this place is
    redefinequote 230 crawling with alien scum,
    redefinequote 231 but I've recovered an
    redefinequote 232 alien data disk.
    redefinequote 233 
    redefinequote 234 
    redefinequote 235 
    redefinequote 236 
    redefinequote 237 Good work Duke.
    redefinequote 238 Keep the disk secure 
    redefinequote 239 and await further
    redefinequote 240 instructions.
    redefinequote 241 I have plenty of alien 
    redefinequote 242 ass to kick in the meantime.
    redefinequote 243 
    redefinequote 244 
    redefinequote 245 Duke out.
    redefinequote 246 
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 /!&
    redefinequote 249 
    redefinequote 250
    //Security cam lines
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE1 Looks like a 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE2 lot'a security!
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE3
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE4
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Area 51
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Gather alien
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 intelligence data.
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 1 // Level 2 - Close Encounter
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, there should be a
    redefinequote 202 Satlink laptop somewhere
    redefinequote 203 in those labs.
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 Once you find it, you
    redefinequote 206 can use it to upload the
    redefinequote 207 data disk you've recovered. 
    redefinequote 208 /!&
    redefinequote 209 General, I've found the 
    redefinequote 210 Satlink laptop. Uploading 
    redefinequote 211 the data to you now.
    redefinequote 212 
    redefinequote 213 It appears they're 
    redefinequote 214 manipulating their DNA
    redefinequote 215 to create an army of 
    redefinequote 216 super alien hybrids.
    redefinequote 217 We'll continue to analyze 
    redefinequote 218 the data you sent, but the
    redefinequote 219 odds are kind of steep. 
    redefinequote 220 
    redefinequote 221 Yeah, I almost feel sorry 
    redefinequote 222 for the scum-sucking,
    redefinequote 223 algae-eaters.
    redefinequote 224 
    redefinequote 225 They picked the wrong
    redefinequote 226 planet this time. 
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 /!&
    redefinequote 229 I've just had a close
    redefinequote 230 encounter of the 
    redefinequote 231 ugliest kind.
    redefinequote 232 
    redefinequote 233 According to the data you
    redefinequote 234 uploaded, that was a 
    redefinequote 235 hybrid Gray alien and they
    redefinequote 236 can resurrect the dead.
    redefinequote 237 
    redefinequote 238 
    redefinequote 239  
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 If that's true, they better 
    redefinequote 242 get ready to work overtime.
    redefinequote 243 
    redefinequote 244 /!&
    redefinequote 245 
    redefinequote 246 
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 
    redefinequote 249 
    redefinequote 250
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Area 51
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Find the Satlink
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 Laptop.
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
    }
else ifvare LEVEL 2 // Level 3 - Hybrid Army
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 General, I've found some 
    redefinequote 202 kind of underground
    redefinequote 203 subway system. 
    redefinequote 204
    redefinequote 205 That system is used to 
    redefinequote 206 move top secret weapons  
    redefinequote 207 and technology around, 
    redefinequote 208 
    redefinequote 209 under the noses of the
    redefinequote 210 American public.
    redefinequote 211
    redefinequote 212
    redefinequote 213 Well it looks like the 
    redefinequote 214 alien scum are using it  
    redefinequote 215 to transport their army 
    redefinequote 216 right under 'our' noses.
    redefinequote 217 Duke, we've learned 
    redefinequote 218 that the aliens need
    redefinequote 219 environmental regulators 
    redefinequote 220 to exist.
    redefinequote 221 Locate and destroy them,
    redefinequote 222 and the aliens will be 
    redefinequote 223 history.
    redefinequote 224
    redefinequote 225 Earth is counting on you. 
    redefinequote 226
    redefinequote 227
    redefinequote 228
    redefinequote 229 I'll derail their plans.
    redefinequote 230 
    redefinequote 231
    redefinequote 232
    redefinequote 233 It's time to kick ass 
    redefinequote 234 and chew bubblegum,
    redefinequote 235 and I'm all out of gum.
    redefinequote 236 /!&
    redefinequote 237 Good work, Duke! Shutting
    redefinequote 238 down the environmental
    redefinequote 239 regulators has destroyed
    redefinequote 240 the hybrid alien army. 
    redefinequote 241 Now get out of there 
    redefinequote 242 in one piece.
    redefinequote 243
    redefinequote 244
    redefinequote 245 Piece of cake.
    redefinequote 246 This was almost too easy.
    redefinequote 247
    redefinequote 248 /!&
    redefinequote 249 You amuse me, 
    redefinequote 250 little human.
    redefinequote 251 As if your pathetic 
    redefinequote 252 attempts could stop us.
    redefinequote 253 You are weak and 
    redefinequote 254 nothing but food.
    redefinequote 255
    redefinequote 256
    redefinequote 257 That's a lot of talk 
    redefinequote 258 from an overgrown insect
    redefinequote 259 with a dead 
    redefinequote 260 invasion army. 
    redefinequote 261
    redefinequote 262
    redefinequote 263
    redefinequote 264
    redefinequote 265 All you've managed to 
    redefinequote 266 do is kill an
    redefinequote 267 expendable fraction 
    redefinequote 268 of our warriors.
    redefinequote 269 Our full army is 
    redefinequote 270 obviously located 
    redefinequote 271 elsewhere.
    redefinequote 272 
    redefinequote 273 I wouldn't expect you 
    redefinequote 274 to understand that with
    redefinequote 275 100 percent of your brain. 
    redefinequote 276 Prepare to die.
    redefinequote 277 Come Get Some.
    redefinequote 278 Time for an
    redefinequote 279 alien autopsy.
    redefinequote 280 /!&
    redefinequote 281 
    redefinequote 282 
    redefinequote 283
    redefinequote 284
    redefinequote 285 General, Area 51 was just
    redefinequote 286 the tip of the iceberg.
    redefinequote 287 There's a much larger 
    redefinequote 288 army hidden elsewhere. 
    redefinequote 289 Any idea where? 
    redefinequote 290
    redefinequote 291
    redefinequote 292
    redefinequote 293 No. That overgrown 
    redefinequote 294 spider was too busy 
    redefinequote 295 dying to talk. 
    redefinequote 296 
    redefinequote 297 But I'm going to jump
    redefinequote 298 through his teleporter
    redefinequote 299 and see where it leads.
    redefinequote 300 
    redefinequote 301 Talk to you on 
    redefinequote 302 the other side.
    redefinequote 303
    redefinequote 304 /!&
    //Security cam lines
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE1 I think I'll 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE2 throw a pipe 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE3 bomb party for
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE4 this guy.
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Area 51
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Destroy the Hybrid
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 Army.
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 3 // Level 4 - Temple of Amun
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, we've pinpointed your 
    redefinequote 202 position via GPS satellite
    redefinequote 203 and you're in the
    redefinequote 204 Temple of Amun in Egypt.
    redefinequote 205 We've also detected a
    redefinequote 206 large power source 
    redefinequote 207 deep inside the temple. 
    redefinequote 208
    redefinequote 209 Time to walk like an
    redefinequote 210 Egyptian, into the 
    redefinequote 211 Temple of Doom, and 
