    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 4 //Level 5 - Inner Sanctum
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 General, this place is full
    redefinequote 202 of frozen alien hybrids. 
    redefinequote 203 This is definitely their 
    redefinequote 204 entire invasion army. 
    redefinequote 205 That adds up.  
    redefinequote 206 The power source we're   
