else ifvare LEVEL 7 //AKA Level 8 - Down Under
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, GPS satellite 
    redefinequote 202 shows that you're
    redefinequote 203 in Sydney, Australia.
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 With their army dead,   
    redefinequote 206 the aliens have to 
    redefinequote 207 be up to something. 
    redefinequote 208 Find out what it is.
    redefinequote 209 Before he died, the 
    redefinequote 210 controller said something 
    redefinequote 211 about a  doomsday weapon
    redefinequote 212 to destroy our atmosphere.
    redefinequote 213 Duke, it's a thin lead,
    redefinequote 214 but we received a distress 
