else ifvare LEVEL 11 //AKA Level 12 - Alien Ship
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 General...Can you read me?
    redefinequote 202 Come in, General. 
    redefinequote 203 
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 D*ke. W**re hav*ng   
    redefinequote 206 tr**ble re*ding Y*u.
    redefinequote 207 Y*ur s**nal is we*k. 
    redefinequote 208 
    redefinequote 209 Nobody jams my 
