else ifvare LEVEL 12 //AKA Level 13 - Cloaking Device
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 These alien freaks are 
    redefinequote 202 on a ship orbiting Earth!
    redefinequote 203 
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 There must be a 
    redefinequote 206 cloaking device to hide it 
    redefinequote 207  
