    redefinequote 209 and that's probably
    redefinequote 210 what's knocked out my
    redefinequote 211 communications.
    redefinequote 212 /!&
    redefinequote 213 General, do you read me? 
    redefinequote 214 
    redefinequote 215 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 Duke! It's good to have 
    redefinequote 218 you back on line.
    redefinequote 219 We just detected an 
    redefinequote 220 alien ship orbiting Earth!
    redefinequote 221 I know. 
    redefinequote 222 I shut down their 
    redefinequote 223 cloaking device. 
    redefinequote 224 
    redefinequote 225 Good work. Get to 
