}
else ifvare LEVEL 13 //AKA Level 14 - Mazeframe
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, the alien ship is
    redefinequote 202 protected by an energy 
    redefinequote 203 field we can't penetrate, 
    redefinequote 204 even with a nuke.
    redefinequote 205 We need you to 
    redefinequote 206 hack into their systems 
    redefinequote 207 so we can try to 
    redefinequote 208 find a weakness./!&
    redefinequote 209 Okay General, 
    redefinequote 210 you're hooked into 
    redefinequote 211 their systems.
    redefinequote 212 
