}
else ifvare LEVEL 14 //AKA Level 15 - Jenny 2
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, we're able to 
    redefinequote 202 scan the ship now.
    redefinequote 203 We've picked up the vital 
    redefinequote 204 signs of 4 human females.
    redefinequote 205 I'll keep an eye 
    redefinequote 206 out for them General.
    redefinequote 207 Any word on shutting  
    redefinequote 208 this ship down? 
    redefinequote 209 We're still analyzing the 
    redefinequote 210 data, Duke. We should have 
    redefinequote 211 a solution by the time 
    redefinequote 212 you find the girls. 
    redefinequote 213 
    redefinequote 214 
    redefinequote 215 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 
    redefinequote 218 
    redefinequote 219 
    redefinequote 220 
    redefinequote 221 Hurry up. 
    redefinequote 222 It never takes me 
    redefinequote 223 long to find a woman. 
    redefinequote 224 /!&
    redefinequote 225 
    redefinequote 226 
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 
    redefinequote 229 Oh, Duke, 
    redefinequote 230 how can I repay  
    redefinequote 231 you for saving me? 
    redefinequote 232
    redefinequote 233 Shake it, baby. 
    redefinequote 234 Hey, you look 
    redefinequote 235 kind of familiar.
    redefinequote 236 
    redefinequote 237 I'm a clone. 
    redefinequote 238 You must have met my 
    redefinequote 239 template, Jenny 1. 
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 I'm Jenny 2 
    redefinequote 242 and my 3 sisters 
    redefinequote 243 are here somewhere.
    redefinequote 244 
    redefinequote 245 
    redefinequote 246 
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 
