    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 15 ///AKA Level 16 - Jenny 3
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, the girl we 
    redefinequote 202 teleported off the 
    redefinequote 203 ship appears to  
    redefinequote 204 be a clone of 
    redefinequote 205 the agent you 
    redefinequote 206 met in Sydney.  
    redefinequote 207 Apparently the agent 
    redefinequote 208 was abducted and cloned.
    redefinequote 209 I'm willing to bet 
    redefinequote 210 the clones were going 
    redefinequote 211 to be breeding stock 
    redefinequote 212 for the aliens.
    redefinequote 213 Intruder alert! 
    redefinequote 214 Intruder alert! 
    redefinequote 215 Eliminate the human! 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 Looks like I'm 
    redefinequote 218 going to have more 
    redefinequote 219 company than usual.
    redefinequote 220 They never seem to learn.
    redefinequote 221 Keep a low profile 
    redefinequote 222 and try to avoid 
    redefinequote 223 engagement with 
    redefinequote 224 the aliens. 
    redefinequote 225 Fine by me. 
    redefinequote 226 I've never liked 
    redefinequote 227 engagements.
    redefinequote 228 /!&
    redefinequote 229 Taking them head on 
    redefinequote 230 is not going to be easy. 
    redefinequote 231 
    redefinequote 232 /!&
    redefinequote 233 Hail to the king, baby! 
    redefinequote 234 
    redefinequote 235 
    redefinequote 236 
    redefinequote 237 Oh, Duke, it was horrible, 
    redefinequote 238 all those alien appendages
    redefinequote 239 all over me! 
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 Well, 
    redefinequote 242 actually that part 
    redefinequote 243 wasn't so bad
    redefinequote 244 
    redefinequote 245 We can play alien 
    redefinequote 246 and schoolgirl later,
    redefinequote 247 but for now we have 
    redefinequote 248 to get you out of here.
    redefinequote 249 General, 
    redefinequote 250 one babe ready 
    redefinequote 251 to beam down. 
    redefinequote 252 /!&
    redefinequote 253 
    redefinequote 254 
    redefinequote 255 
    //Mission objective
