    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Find the engine 
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 room.Rescue Jenny 4. 
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 17 //AKA Level 18 - Alien Lord
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, we have a  
    redefinequote 202 plan that may work, 
    redefinequote 203 but it's risky.
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 Locate the engine 
    redefinequote 206 cooling unit and 
    redefinequote 207 shut it down.
    redefinequote 208 
    redefinequote 209 This should overheat  
    redefinequote 210 the reactor and 
    redefinequote 211 destroy the ship.
    redefinequote 212 
    redefinequote 213 But you're going to need 
    redefinequote 214 to get out of there fast. 
    redefinequote 215 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 Don't worry 
    redefinequote 218 about me General.
    redefinequote 219 
    redefinequote 220 
    redefinequote 221 I'll give these alien 
    redefinequote 222 maggots a hotfoot they'll 
    redefinequote 223 feel all the way to hell. 
    redefinequote 224 /!&
    redefinequote 225 I'm coming for you! 
    redefinequote 226 
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 
    redefinequote 229 The cooling units 
    redefinequote 230 are shut down and 
    redefinequote 231 the reactor is 
    redefinequote 232 starting to heat up. 
    redefinequote 233 Great work Duke. 
    redefinequote 234 Find Jenny 5 and 
    redefinequote 235 get the hell... 
    redefinequote 236 
    redefinequote 237 Earth fools! 
    redefinequote 238
    redefinequote 239 
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 I have the earth 
    redefinequote 242 woman secured. 
    redefinequote 243 If you want her, you'll 
    redefinequote 244 have to go through me. 
    redefinequote 245 Our ship may be  
    redefinequote 246 doomed, but I'll get  
    redefinequote 247 the satisfaction of  
    redefinequote 248 seeing you die with it. 
    redefinequote 249 Not on your 
    redefinequote 250 life ass-goblin.
    redefinequote 251 
    redefinequote 252 
    redefinequote 253 I'll be vacationing
    redefinequote 254 with hot babes, 
    redefinequote 255 while your atoms are 
    redefinequote 256 flying past Uranus./!&
    redefinequote 257 Oh, Duke, 
    redefinequote 258 I'm so happy 
    redefinequote 259 I could just 
    redefinequote 260 grab you and...
    redefinequote 261 No time, baby.
    redefinequote 262 The only thing that's 
    redefinequote 263 gonna blow is this ship.
    redefinequote 264 And soon!
    redefinequote 265 General, Jenny 5 is ready. 
    redefinequote 266 Energize. 
    redefinequote 267 
    redefinequote 268 /!&
    redefinequote 269 
    redefinequote 270
    //Security cam lines
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE1 I'm coming for you! 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE2
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE3
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE4
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Alien Ship
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Shutdown the cooling
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 unit. Save the Girl. 
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 18 //AKA Level 19 - Run Your Ass Off!
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, our sensors show 
    redefinequote 202 that the reactors 
    redefinequote 203 are super critical 
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 and they are going  
    redefinequote 206 to explode in less 
