    redefinequote 213 
    redefinequote 214 
    redefinequote 215 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 That's going to 
    redefinequote 218 be a problem.
    redefinequote 219 
    redefinequote 220 
    redefinequote 221 Teleporting Jenny 5 
    redefinequote 222 strained our teleporter 
    redefinequote 223 pad to the limit 
    redefinequote 224 and burned it out.
    redefinequote 225 We can't get it 
