    redefinequote 232
    redefinequote 233 Who needs luck? 
    redefinequote 234 Always bet on Duke. 
    redefinequote 235 
    redefinequote 236 /!&
    redefinequote 237 
    redefinequote 238
    redefinequote 239 
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 
    redefinequote 242 
    redefinequote 243 
    redefinequote 244 
    redefinequote 245 
    redefinequote 246 
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 
