defstate eu_script
ifvare LEVEL 0 // Level 1 - Gathering Intel
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke!
    redefinequote 202 General Graves here.
    redefinequote 203 
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 A group of aliens are 
    redefinequote 206 running a covert operation
    redefinequote 207 from deep within Area 51.
    redefinequote 208 We understand it has
    redefinequote 209 something to do with a
    redefinequote 210 new alien species. You must 
    redefinequote 211 seek and recover data 
    redefinequote 212 on them. 
    redefinequote 213 Damn. Teleporter's broke 
    redefinequote 214 - took most of my guns.
    redefinequote 215 
    redefinequote 216 
    redefinequote 217 Someone's gonna pay, 
    redefinequote 218 
    redefinequote 219 
    redefinequote 220 
    redefinequote 221 and I'm all ready to sign 
    redefinequote 222 their checks with my 
    redefinequote 223 Desert Eagle.
    redefinequote 224 
    redefinequote 225 Who wants some!
    redefinequote 226 
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 /!&
    redefinequote 229 General! 
    redefinequote 230 I have found  
    redefinequote 231 a Data Disk!
    redefinequote 232 
    redefinequote 233 I bet it contains
    redefinequote 234 the details we need
    redefinequote 235 to learn more about
    redefinequote 236 the new breed of aliens.
    redefinequote 237 Excellent. 
    redefinequote 238 Infiltrate the next secure 
    redefinequote 239 section and await
    redefinequote 240 further instructions. 
    redefinequote 241 I'm on my way...
    redefinequote 242 
    redefinequote 243 
    redefinequote 244 /!&
    redefinequote 245 
    redefinequote 246  
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 
    redefinequote 249 
    redefinequote 250
    //Security cam lines
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE1 Looks like a 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE2 lot'a security!
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE3
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE4
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Area 51
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Find the Data Disk.
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 1 // Level 2 - Close Encounter
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, there is a SatLink 
    redefinequote 202 laptop in your vicinity.
    redefinequote 203 Find it so we can upload
    redefinequote 204 the Data Disk.
    redefinequote 205 
    redefinequote 206 
    redefinequote 207 
    redefinequote 208 /!&
    redefinequote 209 I've found the Satlink.
    redefinequote 210 Uploading the data now.
    redefinequote 211 
    redefinequote 212 
    redefinequote 213 Oh my God! It looks like
    redefinequote 214 they're manipulating their
    redefinequote 215 DNA to create an army of 
    redefinequote 216 super alien hybrids.
    redefinequote 217 If this army should 
    redefinequote 218 ever be unleashed...  
    redefinequote 219 You have got to
    redefinequote 220 stop them, Duke!
    redefinequote 221 Stop an entire army  
    redefinequote 222 of aliens by myself?! 
    redefinequote 223 That's not exactly 
    redefinequote 224 a fair fight. 
    redefinequote 225 The odds are stacked too 
    redefinequote 226 heavily against them!  
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 /!&
    redefinequote 229 I've just had a close
    redefinequote 230 encounter of the 
    redefinequote 231 ugliest kind.
    redefinequote 232 
    redefinequote 233 That was a Gray. 
    redefinequote 234 According to the data you 
    redefinequote 235 just uploaded Grays can 
    redefinequote 236 resurrect the dead! 
    redefinequote 237 We recommend you take them 
    redefinequote 238 out of the equation first. 
    redefinequote 239 
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 If they can resurrect the 
    redefinequote 242 dead they'll be working  
    redefinequote 243 overtime in my wake. 
    redefinequote 244 /!&
    redefinequote 245 
    redefinequote 246 
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 
    redefinequote 249 
    redefinequote 250
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Area 51
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Find the SatLink.
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 2 // Level 3 - Hybrid Army
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 General,
    redefinequote 202 I am in some kind 
    redefinequote 203 of subway!
    redefinequote 204 
    redefinequote 205 It was built years ago 
    redefinequote 206 to move equipment secretly.
    redefinequote 207
    redefinequote 208
    redefinequote 209 
    redefinequote 210 
    redefinequote 211 
    redefinequote 212 
    redefinequote 213 Well it looks like the 
    redefinequote 214 alien scum are preparing to
    redefinequote 215 use it to ferry out their
    redefinequote 216 army right under our noses.
    redefinequote 217 Find a way to destroy  
    redefinequote 218 their army before they
    redefinequote 219 succeed.
    redefinequote 220 
    redefinequote 221 
    redefinequote 222 
    redefinequote 223 
    redefinequote 224
    redefinequote 225 
    redefinequote 226 
    redefinequote 227 
    redefinequote 228 
    redefinequote 229 Don't worry, their plans
    redefinequote 230 are about to be derailed.
    redefinequote 231 
    redefinequote 232 /!&
    redefinequote 233 
    redefinequote 234 
    redefinequote 235 
    redefinequote 236 
    redefinequote 237 Good work, Duke! 
    redefinequote 238 You have shut down their
    redefinequote 239 environmental regulators.
    redefinequote 240 
    redefinequote 241 The alien army has
    redefinequote 242 been destroyed.
    redefinequote 243 Now get out of there
    redefinequote 244 in one piece.
    redefinequote 245 Piece of cake.
    redefinequote 246 
    redefinequote 247 
    redefinequote 248 /!&
    redefinequote 249 The futility of your 
    redefinequote 250 persistence amuses me.
    redefinequote 251 It's a shame that I
    redefinequote 252 must kill you now.
    redefinequote 253 
    redefinequote 254 
    redefinequote 255 
    redefinequote 256 
    redefinequote 257 You and what army? 
    redefinequote 258 
    redefinequote 259 
    redefinequote 260
    redefinequote 261 How naive you are to 
    redefinequote 262 believe you've destroyed 
    redefinequote 263 our army.
    redefinequote 264
    redefinequote 265 You've managed to kill 
    redefinequote 266 but a small fraction
    redefinequote 267 of warriors, no more 
    redefinequote 268 than a minor setback.
    redefinequote 269 Our full army is safely 
    redefinequote 270 located far from here as 
    redefinequote 271 we prepare for the 
    redefinequote 272 extinction of 
    redefinequote 273 the human race.
    redefinequote 274 I shall begin the process 
    redefinequote 275 today with your extinction!
    redefinequote 276 
    redefinequote 277 Time for a little 
    redefinequote 278 alien autopsy,
    redefinequote 279 RPG style.
    redefinequote 280 
    redefinequote 281 Come get some! 
    redefinequote 282 
    redefinequote 283 
    redefinequote 284 /!&
    redefinequote 285 General, Area 51 is the 
    redefinequote 286 tip of the iceberg.
    redefinequote 287 There's a much larger 
    redefinequote 288 army hidden elsewhere! 
    redefinequote 289 Understood.
    redefinequote 290 Stay put while we get 
    redefinequote 291 a fix on their location.
    redefinequote 292 
    redefinequote 293 No can do.
    redefinequote 294 If there's more of them
    redefinequote 295 out there then every
    redefinequote 296 second is precious.
    redefinequote 297 The fastest way to locate
    redefinequote 298 the army is for me to
    redefinequote 299 follow their slimy trail
    redefinequote 300 through this Teleporter.
    redefinequote 301 Hail to the King, baby! 
    redefinequote 302 
    redefinequote 303
    redefinequote 304 /!&
    //Security cam lines
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE1 I think I'll 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE2 throw a pipe 
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE3 bomb party for
    redefinequote CAM_QUOTE4 this guy.
    //Mission objective
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE1 Area 51
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE2 Stop the invasion!
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE3 
    redefinequote OBJECTIVE_QUOTE4 
}
else ifvare LEVEL 3 // Level 4 - Temple of Amun 
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 Duke, you are at 
