else ifvare LEVEL 4 //Level 5 - Inner Sanctum
{
    redefinequote 200 
    redefinequote 201 General, this place is 
    redefinequote 202 full of frozen hybrids. 
    redefinequote 203 It looks like 
    redefinequote 204 an invasion army. 
    redefinequote 205 That makes sense. 
    redefinequote 206 The power source we are
    redefinequote 207 detecting must be their
    redefinequote 208 environmental regulators.
    redefinequote 209 We need more information 
    redefinequote 210 to know how to shut
    redefinequote 211 them down.
    redefinequote 212
    redefinequote 213 Leave it to me. 
    redefinequote 214 Wherever I find these 
